@startuml SmartLost_Publication_Activity
title SmartLost - UML Listing Publication Activity\nUC04 Publish a lost or found listing, with optional UC05 photo analysis\nProposed semester behaviour - not implemented
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF7ED
  DiamondBorderColor #C2410C
}

|Registered User|
start
:Select New listing;
|Listings Service|
:Validate access token and derive acting user;
if (Authenticated?) then (yes)
  :Create and persist a private Draft\nowned by the acting user;
else (no)
  :Reject unauthenticated request;
  stop
endif

|Registered User|
:Choose Lost or Found and enter\ntitle, description, campus location\nand occurrence date;
note right
  Categories may be entered manually
  or completed after optional analysis.
  Colour and distinguishing traits are optional.
end note

repeat
  |Registered User|
  :Choose an optional photograph\nAttach, replace, retry or remove;
  |Listings Service|
  :Recheck draft ownership;
  if (Photograph supplied?) then (yes)
    :Validate actual JPEG/PNG format,\nsuccessful decoding and size <= 10 MiB;
    if (Valid image?) then (yes)
      |Private Photo Storage|
      :Attempt private blob upload;
      |Listings Service|
      if (Upload and metadata association succeeded?) then (yes)
        :Associate the available photo with the draft\nInvalidate analysis for a replaced photo;
      else (no)
        :Preserve valid draft data\nDo not associate an unavailable photo\nShow retry or remove option;
      endif
    else (no)
      :Reject the new image and preserve draft\nShow replace or remove option;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Keep the draft without a photograph\nInvalidate obsolete photo analysis;
  endif
repeat while (Unresolved photo error?) is (yes) not (no)

|Registered User|
if (Validated photo exists and user requests analysis?) then (yes)
  |Listings Service|
  :Check ownership and capture\nphoto identity and draft revision\nExpose analysis progress;
  :Request analysis through the authorised\ninternal Matching contract;
  |Matching Service|
  :Obtain the photo through authorised Listings access\nCall local AI through the authenticated tunnel;
  |Local AI Runtime|
  :Attempt bounded Qwen analysis;
  |Matching Service|
  :Validate the structured result or report unavailability;
  |Listings Service|
  if (Usable result before the configured timeout?) then (yes)
    if (Photo and relevant draft values still current?) then (yes)
      :Present proposed objects, categories and traits\nDo not infer owner, location or occurrence date;
      |Registered User|
      :Select the intended object if several are detected\nAccept, edit or discard suggestions;
    else (no)
      :Discard stale suggestions\nPreserve newer manual edits;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Show unavailable or failed analysis outcome\nPreserve valid draft and offer manual entry;
  endif
endif

|Registered User|
:Enter or confirm final categories and traits\nReview the complete listing;
if (Publish now?) then (yes)
  :Submit publication for this draft;
else (no)
  |Listings Service|
  :Save permitted draft changes privately\nDo not enqueue it for matching;
  stop
endif

|Listings Service|
:Recheck authentication, ownership\nand publication request identity;
if (Same publication already committed?) then (yes)
  :Return the existing publication outcome\nDo not create another listing or update task;
  stop
endif
:Validate expected draft revision, type, title,\ndescription, confirmed categories, location,\nnon-future occurrence date and any photo reference;
if (Authorised, current and valid?) then (yes)
  :Normalise confirmed categories\nPreserve unrecognised labels for manual search;
else (no)
  :Reject invalid, unauthorised or stale publication\nPreserve existing data and return errors or conflict;
  stop
endif

:Atomically commit Draft -> Open,\nauthor, publication time and revision,\nand durable Matching update work;
if (Transaction committed?) then (yes)
  :Return the Open listing\nwith pending synchronisation status;
  note right
    A durable worker delivers the update later.
    Matching failure leaves work pending/failed
    and retryable; it does not undo publication.
    No photo or successful AI analysis is required.
  end note
  |Registered User|
  :See publication confirmation\nand current processing status;
else (no)
  :Roll back publication and update work together\nKeep the draft private and report failure;
endif
stop
@enduml
